{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The most this claim can be worth is $0.32, not the $1.50 the rider asks. Running POL-RD-02 on the fare in the payments ledger: (base fare 3.80 + 0.75 x 3.2 km optimal + 0.28 x 7.0 min optimal) x the 1.0 surge_multiplier recorded on the fare breakdown, plus the 0.80 platform fee, gives a recomputed optimal-route fare of $8.96; charged_total of $9.28 less $8.96 leaves a refund of $0.32 before rounding. There is no ERP and no airport surcharge to add, and no promo or waiting-time line to subtract.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02845", "EV-TRIP-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.recomputed_fare",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "That $0.32 refund is below the SGD 0.50 de minimis floor POL-RD-02 sets, so even taking the rider's case at its highest the outcome is NO_ACTION and the $9.28 charge is left standing as the present state under POL-GEN-03. NO_ACTION is party-relative, and on this rider-filed dispute the fare_breakdown shows payment_status CHARGED with refund_issued_sgd 0.00, so nothing moves.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02", "POL-GEN-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.refund.below_de_minimis",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The measured excess of 0.85 km and 26.56% is far short of the 50% / 8.0 km materiality limb of POL-RD-01, so the deviation is not MATERIAL and POL-RD-06's driver_profile check is not even triggered on this trip. No FULL_REFUND uplift under POL-RD-06(b) is available, and the POL-RD-02 figure of $0.32 is therefore the ceiling on this dispute.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02845", "EV-TRIP-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01", "POL-RD-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_km",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if the driver_profile check were consulted, no repeat-deviation pattern is established under POL-RD-06: driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 1, below the threshold of 3, and 1 divided by driver_profile.completed_trips_90d of 316 is roughly 0.3%, below the 5% ratio. No adverse finding and no driver-conduct referral follows from the profile.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The gps_trace is unimpaired for policy purposes: 100% coverage, 37 fixes at a 10 second interval, no gaps and a max_gap_sec of 0.0, so none of the POL-RD-07(a) to (c) limbs fires. With no impairment there is no basis for escalation under POL-RD-10(3) or POL-RD-10(1), and this case must be decided on the arithmetic rather than sent to a reviewer.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-07", "POL-RD-10"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The fare breakdown carries no ERP gantry lines (erp_gantries empty, optimal_route_erp 0.00) and no airport surcharge, and the trip neither originates nor ends at an airport, so POL-RD-09 affords no standalone pass-through or billing-integrity refund to be added on top of the $0.32 already computed.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02845", "EV-GPS-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.components.optimal_route_erp",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The bundle holds no traffic_advisory for this trip: EV-ADVIS-02845-01 is MISSING (issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT), carries no payload and has weight_multiplier 0.0, so it can carry no fact. But the driver asserts no external traffic cause - his counterparty_statement is 'Followed the app.' - and cites no advisory, so under POL-RD-13 the absence is a gap in the bundle rather than an exculpatory clause invoked against a cited artifact, and POL-RD-10(5) is not engaged. The missing artifact is cited here only for its absence.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-02845-01", "EV-TRIP-02845"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-13", "POL-RD-10", "POL-GEN-02"],
      "asserted_weight": 0.0
    }
  ]
