      "claim": "The driver's only answer of record is 'Followed the app', which names no advisory, no road and no artifact. No traffic_advisory covers this trip: EV-ADVIS-02845-01 is MISSING, carries no payload and has weight_multiplier 0.0, and the rider discloses that impairment and that the trace's derived advisory set is empty. Under POL-RD-13 the POL-RD-03 comparison cannot be run where no advisory covers the trip window, POL-RD-03 is unavailable, and the driver's traffic assertion carries no weight under POL-RD-08. Because the driver cites no advisory identifier, the absence of the advisory is a gap in the bundle and not an exculpatory clause invoked against a cited artifact within POL-RD-10(5), so no escalation follows from it. Nothing in this record reduces the measured excess.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-02845-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}

