present state (payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00). There is no ERP gantry line and no airport surcharge, so POL-RD-09 affords no standalone pass-through or billing-integrity correction. Nor is any driver compensation due: the fare ledger billed 4.0 km against a trace of 4.05 km, a shortfall of 0.05 km, far under the 1.0 km threshold in the POL-RD-04 compensation limb.\n\nTwo housekeeping points. The rider's submission about the absent traffic advisory (EV-ADVIS-02845-01, status MISSING, weight_multiplier 0.0) was discarded by the referee because it cited that impaired artifact without naming its issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, as POL-GEN-02(1) requires; it would not have changed the result, because the driver asserted no external traffic cause and cited no advisory, so POL-RD-03 is simply unavailable and no POL-RD-10(5) escalation is engaged. And the missing advisory does not drag down confidence: it carries no deciding fact here. Confidence is 0.95, capped by the deciding artifacts — the GPS trace, trip record and fare breakdown — all at weight_multiplier 1.0, none below the 0.70 floor. The monetary effect is nil and below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold, so nothing is held or collected; either party may still appeal under POL-GEN-04."
